## SQ-CDQ-00
@group A
@commands boot, grep `latest.log`
@pass `Done (`; mixin lines apply `creativedelight.mixins.json` with no `InvalidInjectionException` / `@Mixin target ... not found`; no `Error occurred while handling event` from `*/cooking.js`, `<mod>/compost.js`
@fails a `require = 1` miss names the injector: compare with the javap check (22.1)
@jars creativecommon creativedelight
@reviewed 2026-11-16
bootexpect Done \(
bootreject InvalidInjectionException|@Mixin target .* not found
bootreject Error occurred while handling event.*(cooking|compost)\.js
bootreject (?i)(/cooking|/compost)\.js.*(error|exception)
## SQ-CDQ-01 | remainder buffer (server half): pot keeps a milk bottle's glass bottle; kettle keeps honey's
@group A, client
@commands remainder_buffer.md RB-01 to RB-11 on a cooking pot and a kettle (bottle, bowl, bucket leftovers, full buffer stalls, hopper pulls)
@pass as RB-
@fails Creative Common's old pot mixins still present (two jars mismatched)
@jars creativecommon creativedelight
@from batches/r1102b/s2_A.qb
@reviewed 2026-11-16
# pot: glow berry custard (glow berries, milk, egg, sugar) with a milk bottle as the milk, no bowl / bottle as container
> cdevtest rdetail glow_berry_custard
> setblock {H1+2} {H2} {H3+138} minecraft:campfire[lit=true]
> setblock {H1+2} {H2+1} {H3+138} farmersdelight:cooking_pot{Inventory:{Size:9,Items:[{Slot:0b,id:"minecraft:glow_berries",Count:1b},{Slot:1b,id:"farmersdelight:milk_bottle",Count:1b},{Slot:2b,id:"minecraft:egg",Count:1b},{Slot:3b,id:"minecraft:sugar",Count:1b}]}}
> kill @e[type=minecraft:item]
> cdevtest tickwarp 500
waitlog verb=tickwarp end=done 60
> data get block {H1+2} {H2+1} {H3+138}
> zcount {H1} {H2-1} {H3+136} {H1+4} {H2+3} {H3+140}
waitlog \[zcount\] entities 30
expect farmersdelight:glow_berry_custard
reject item:minecraft:glass_bottle
expect minecraft:glass_bottle
look the glass bottle is in the pot's block data (container slot 7 or the buffer), never an item entity; the kettle half is SQ-RSP-05 (honey bottle kept); RB-01 to RB-11 in full (stall, hopper pulls, bowls, buckets) stay with the client run

