## SQ-CDQ-05 | compost [qol] on: Farmer's, Fungi, Veggies, Vintage rows have source value (off half: s2_Coff.qb SQ-CDQ-05b)
@group A
@commands `/dumpcompost`; compare `kubejs/exported/compost/compost.json` with the 2026-10-25 dump for the 101 Farmer's, Fungi, Veggies and Vintage items; then `compost = false`, `/reload`, dump again
