@@text `OUT/srv/config/creativeengineering-common.toml` `[crop_drops.soil_yield.crops]` and restart (a running server does
@@text not reread the toml; `/reload` alone keeps the old switches, 2026-10-28). `tools/soil_yield_probe/sy_probe.js`
@@text (`/syt roll`) rolls the loot table on placed blocks instead of counting harvests. Count drops over 30+ harvests per case (`/fill` the soil, place ripe crops with `/setblock ...[age=7]`,
@@text `/fill ... air destroy`, count with a hopper or `/clear @s <item> 0`).
